Z||000029||Steven||12-27-1999||01:11 PM||||Sorry about the delay. I picked up the radio new at a place up here called Specmo. It's a "Authorized AC Delco Service Center." The type of place that a dealer would send your radio out for repairs if you wanted them to. As for mods that had to be made, I bought an adaptor harness #16140051 from GM, and I had to put two washers between the radio and the panel that the radio gets screwed to (otherwise I would have had about a 3/8" gap between the radio and the cover/bezel.)||||reg||1
Z||000030||Monkeyman||12-27-1999||01:47 PM||||NO!  WAIT!  STOP!  You have to leave that 3/8" gap in there to allow for expansion during warm weather.||||reg||1
